sequenceDiagram
    participant Provider as API Provider<br/>(FakePay/Stripe)
    participant Webhook as Webhook Handler
    participant ChangeEngine as Change Detection<br/>Engine
    participant Scanner as AST Scanner<br/>(Tree-sitter)
    participant Impact as Impact Analysis<br/>Engine
    participant Planner as Migration<br/>Planner
    participant Recipe as Recipe Engine<br/>(Deterministic)
    participant Sandbox as Sandbox<br/>Validator
    participant GitHub as GitHub API
    participant DB as Neon Postgres

    Provider->>Webhook: Breaking Change Released<br/>(v1 → v2)
    Webhook->>DB: Store Event
    Webhook->>ChangeEngine: Trigger Analysis

    ChangeEngine->>ChangeEngine: Fetch OpenAPI Specs<br/>(v1 & v2)
    ChangeEngine->>ChangeEngine: Diff Specs<br/>Detect Changes
    ChangeEngine->>DB: Store Changes<br/>(ENDPOINT_RENAMED, etc.)
    
    Note over ChangeEngine: 3 Breaking Changes Detected:<br/>- Endpoint renamed<br/>- Field now required<br/>- Response schema changed

    ChangeEngine->>Scanner: Scan Repository
    Scanner->>Scanner: Clone Repository
    Scanner->>Scanner: Parse Files (Tree-sitter)<br/>TypeScript/Python/Go
    Scanner->>Scanner: Extract API Usages<br/>(exact line numbers)
    Scanner->>DB: Store Usages<br/>(15 usages found)

    Scanner->>Impact: Trigger Impact Analysis
    Impact->>DB: Fetch Usages + Changes
    Impact->>Impact: Map Changes to Files
    Impact->>Impact: Calculate Risk Level
    Impact->>DB: Store Impact Report<br/>(4 files affected, HIGH risk)

    Impact->>Planner: Generate Migration Plan
    Planner->>DB: Fetch Changes & Impact
    Planner->>Planner: Match to Recipe<br/>(FakePay v1→v2)
    
    alt Deterministic Recipe Available
        Planner->>Recipe: Use FakePayV1ToV2Recipe
        Recipe->>Recipe: Generate File Patches<br/>(client, types, route, tests)
    else Unknown Provider
        Planner->>Recipe: Fallback to LLM
        Recipe->>Recipe: Generate patches via Gemini
    end

    Recipe->>DB: Store Migration Plan<br/>(confidence: 97%)

    Recipe->>Sandbox: Validate Patches
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: Create Isolated Env
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: Apply Patches
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: npm install
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: npm run build
    Sandbox->>Sandbox: npm test
    
    alt Validation Passes
        Sandbox->>DB: Store Results<br/>(PASS, 25/25 tests)
        Sandbox->>GitHub: Create Draft PR
        GitHub-->>Sandbox: PR URL
        Sandbox->>DB: Update Migration<br/>(status: pr_created)
        Note over Sandbox,GitHub: ✓ Draft PR Created<br/>Human Review Required
    else Validation Fails
        Sandbox->>DB: Store Results<br/>(FAIL, 18/25 tests)
        Sandbox->>DB: Update Migration<br/>(status: failed)
        Note over Sandbox: ✗ PR Blocked<br/>Safety Gate Triggered
    end

    Sandbox->>Sandbox: Cleanup & Destroy
